"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Zao\">Zao</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a>, May Spawn somewhere between the following two coordinates <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33209,31242,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33209, 31242, 7)</a> and <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33235,31244,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33235, 31244, 7)</a> or <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33282,31248,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33282, 31248, 7)</a>).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tBattlemaster Zunzu attacks in melee range. Battlemaster Zunzu never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p> <b>Mages:</b> should be at least level 120 to solo these without <a href=\"#/wiki/Magic%20Shield\">Magic Shield</a>. Be sure to keep exura gran or vita handy as they can deal massive damage. Use <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wave\">Energy Wave</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Energy%20Beam\">Great Energy Beam</a> as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a>, or Ice Wave as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a>. You can also use <a href=\"#/wiki/Ice%20Strike\">Ice Strike</a> and your favourite weapon, but considering their high amount of health, that is not recommended unless you're in a party.\n<b>Knights:</b> should kill this using <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a> and Blood Rage if you're fighting them solo. In a party, rely on your shooters to help you.\n<b>Paladins:</b> should run them, but be very careful not to attract more lizards while doing so or you will have a hard time. Use strong ammunition to drop them as fast as possible.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<p>When the <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a> were first created, there was a glitch/bug that spawned several Battlemaster Zunzu's in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple%20of%20Equilibrium\">Temple of Equilibrium</a>. It is not confirmed whether or not this glitch/bug can still occur.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 21 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 50 samples — current sample size is below this threshold.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tas